{"synopsis":"Hidup ini sudah hancur katamu Menurutku ini baikbaik saja\nSetelah empat tahun menjalani kehidupan yang ditakdirkan untuk gagal apa pun yang terjadi\nKang Soohyun berpikir dia akhirnya bisa bersinar sebagai seorang aktor\nTepat ketika dia hendak meraih cahaya tersebut sebuah truk dari arah berlawanan bertabrakan dengan mobilnya\nmembawanya ke ambang kematian dan jatuh dalam keputusasaan\nTunggu aku belum mati kan\nKetika dia sadar pantulan di cermin adalah dirinya yang paling lucu di usia 5 tahun\nYa kehidupan ini dimulai dari menjadi aktor cilik\nDengan demikian karir akting aktor Kang Soohyun dimulai","alternative_title":"이번 생은 아역부터","author":"Maneul Sogeum, Mental Garumon","artist":"Earl Greymon","chapters":[{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"11ead074-ea34-43fa-b9aa-71a084bbcc1c","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2024-12-02"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"40a1125d-e613-4d93-b04f-9551df7001ce","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"e7d43405-6459-48b7-a9d6-3a447f63806f","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2024-12-02"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"ea19c4f4-0219-49d5-8bfc-59c0f7c9c9c5","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"f069358b-8790-47b3-a091-ce62b966d893","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"a2056698-7d59-4cc2-ada5-ccdaba13af24","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"3c81c133-74fd-4313-90af-77e23fb4d00b","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"9d8c99f8-8a73-49b1-b0b6-5383497b5ebd","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"afd7e0f6-2e73-429f-acf1-2695f52dabc9","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2024-12-02"},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"ddc2a123-9266-4391-8629-ff87ff59f307","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"1916b277-17a8-4040-87b5-af11cd64f224","title":"C